  "title": "Aharoni-Berger conjecture",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Conjecture If $M_1,\\ldots,M_k$ are matroids on $E$ and $\\sum_{i=1}^k rk_{M_i}(X_i) \\ge \\ell (k-1)$ for every partition $\\{X_1,\\ldots,X_k\\}$ of $E$, then there exists $X \\subseteq E$ with $|X| = \\ell$ which is independent in every $M_i$.",
